cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its computational results, please cite the accompanying manuscript and the archived software release."
title: "Computational archive for Smallest Graphs with Non-Log-Concave Total-Domination Polynomials and a Correction for Generalized Barbell Graphs"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Joensen"
    given-names: "Jón"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-2365-9519"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
abstract: >-
  Source code, graph census inputs, saved computational outputs, and
  structural-analysis materials accompanying the manuscript Smallest
  Graphs with Non-Log-Concave Total-Domination Polynomials and a
  Correction for Generalized Barbell Graphs. The archive contains an
  exhaustive Python census of unlabeled graphs without isolated vertices
  through order eight, an independent JavaScript verification, graph6
  validation tools, and an inclusion-exclusion analysis of an exceptional
  graph.
keywords:
  - graph theory
  - total domination
  - total-domination polynomial
  - log-concavity
  - unimodality
  - graph census
  - graph6
  - computational verification
